config JTAG_NPCM
	bool "NPCM JTAG driver"
	depends on SOC_FAMILY_NPCM
	help
	  This option enables the JTAG driver for NPCM family of
	  processors.
	  Say y if you wish to use JTAG channels on NPCM MCU.
